# Scope declaration installed by the orchestrator for the duration of a scan.
#
# Semgrep's SHIPPED DEFAULT excludes tests/ (and other paths) whenever a project
# has no .semgrepignore of its own. That exclusion is not a decision anyone
# made, and undeclared scope reduction is precisely the failure this pipeline
# exists to catch -- so we replace the default rather than inherit it.
#
# WE SCAN TESTS. Test trees in this portfolio hold credential fixtures and
# binary parser inputs; they are security-relevant, not boilerplate.
#
# Noise is suppressed BY RULE ID, never by path. Exclude the behaviour, not the
# software: a rule suppressed by id stays suppressed for a stated reason, while
# a suppressed directory silently hides everything that ever lands in it.
.git/
node_modules/
.venv/
venv/
*.min.js
